title: "EngageGraph: A Reproducible Benchmark and Toolkit for Temporal App-Engagement Prediction"
abstract: "A leakage-free January-to-February app-adoption benchmark, four reference models, paired bootstrap evaluation, and a domain-agnostic recommendation API with pluggable domain profiles."
